metryLog per return waypoint + UPDATE handling=AT_HUB", "variant": "default", "note": "Notify hub technicians drone arrived for inspection"}], "activations": [{"participant": "router", "from": 155, "to": 684, "type": "backend"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 225, "to": 264, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 289, "to": 356, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 381, "to": 450, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 475, "to": 514, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 535, "to": 548, "type": "database"}, {"participant": "notif", "from": 591, "to": 648, "type": "messagebus"}, {"participant": "sim", "from": 793, "to": 940, "type": "backend"}, {"participant": "db", "from": 793, "to": 940, "type": "database"}], "cards": [{"dot": "emerald", "title": "Path A — Operator Emergency Land", "items": ["Requires FLYING / IN_PROGRESS / ACTIVE_MISSION status (400 otherwise)", "Mission → INCIDENT_RETURN, handling_status = CANNOT_CONTINUE", "Incident: severity=HIGH, status=OPEN, requires_technical_inspection=True", "MaintenanceAlert: source=EmergencyLand, status=Pending", "Drone → MAINTENANCE; notifies all operators + customer"]}, {"dot": "cyan", "title": "Path B — Simulator Incident (FAILSAFE_RTH)", "items": ["Triggered at armed_incident step or random probability", "_trigger_incident() sets mission → INCIDENT_RETURN in DB", "Simulator calls _fly_incident_return() to nearest safe hub", "Returns inserting TelemetryLog along return path", "On landing: handling_status=AT_HUB; Technician must confirm-arrival"]}, {"dot": "rose", "title": "Three Incident Types (Simulator)", "items": ["FAILSAFE_RTH: controlled return to nearest hub (recoverable)", "SIGNAL_LOSS: simulator stops; watcher creates HIGH incident after 10s", "DISCONNECT_CRASH: last TelemetryLog at crash coords (alt=0, speed=0); Mission→FAILED; Drone→MAINTENANCE; Incident HIGH"]}, {"dot": "violet", "title": "Also: failsafe-execute", "items": ["POST /failsafe-execute with acti